# TLC leaves a trace module + a states/ dir per run; they are outputs, not sources.
# Left untracked deliberately: `git add <dir>` would sweep them in, and that once put 1.5 GB into a
# single commit and got the whole push rejected. Stage by PATH here, always.
formal/states/
formal/*_TTrace_*.tla
formal/*_TTrace_*.bin
formal/*.cfg
# compiled benches — rebuild with the one-line g++ command in each file's header
protocol_bench
scoring_bench
protocol_multi_bench
